      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think colored aura might give enough signal what you're doing. Looking down can tell different like AFKing. It's not always good sign. You can even look down whole time on small avatar. :)\n\nAnother idea is icon above the name bar. When you use menu, a icon showed above the name bar like \"MENU\" icon, or universal like [M] rectangle. If you see it, you will know he is not present in game and is checking menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
